  material "AISI 1045" densmm ralge(10 mm, 60 mm)
  para0 mm symmetric
  extrude slot from %ect(on=body.cap_end, w=j_inner_a), pin_bore.rim(jaw_inn

  sketch side Rn plane.XZ {
    rect outline corner=(0 mm, -(jaw_gap / 2 + jaw_thtrain concentric(nose, pin)
